I agree with @GromNaN

While I understand the issue, the lock will still need to be released when the message fail and is not added back to the queue in order to allow adding another message.

So the lock need to be eventually renewed only when the message fail and is added back to the queue.

NB: Be aware that in case of success is your user do again the action there wont be lock and the message will be added in the queue so the message will be retreated soon. In compare to this, it's not a big deal having two messages in the queue. The main purpose is to avoid having dozen of similar message.
But I agree it would be awesome to deduplicate more

